## Code Comments Policy
- Do not add comments to code unless explicitly requested by the user
- Only include comments when specifically asked for documentation or explanation
- Keep code clean and self-explanatory without unnecessary inline comments


## Coding rules

### Component Architecture
- Always analyze component reusability and separate into:
  - **UX/UI**: Pure UI components without business logic
  - **Logical**: Components that handle state and business logic
  - **Sections**: Components that represent complete application sections

### Data Management
- Always use data from JSON files located in the `data/` folder
- Avoid hardcoding data directly in components
- Maintain separation between data and presentation

## Styling Rules

- Avoid in-line styles on html tags